ame><surname>Madlung</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Siemen</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Ellory</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Lepple-Wienhues</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Gulbins</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The involvement of caspases in the CD95(Fas/Apo-1)- but not swelling-induced cellular taurine release from Jurkat T-lymphocytes</article-title><source>Pflugers Arch</source><year>2000</year><volume>440</volume><fpage>93</fpage><lpage>99</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Pflugers Arch||440|93||bib15|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10864002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lei</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Peeling</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A localized double-quantum filter for <italic>in vivo</italic> detection of taurine</article-title><source>Magn Reson Med</source><year>1999</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>454</fpage><lpage>460</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Magn Reson Med||42|454||bib16|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10467289</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lyng</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Sitter</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Bathen</surname><given-names>TF</given-names></name><name><surname>Jensen</surname><given-names>LR</given-names></name><name><surname>Sundf&#x000f8;r</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kristensen</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name><name><surname>Gribbestad</surname><given-names>IS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Metabolic mapping by use of high-resolution magic angle spinning <sup>1</sup>H MR spect